WEBVTT

00:00.300 --> 00:03.350
<b>Earth</b>

00:16.160 --> 00:17.630
<b>It's completely burnt out.</b>

00:17.630 --> 00:18.770
<b>That won't do.</b>

00:18.770 --> 00:20.130
<b>Should we return it to this one?</b>

00:20.130 --> 00:21.470
<b>Here are some cartridges.</b>

00:21.470 --> 00:23.180
<b>I've got some refills.</b>

00:23.180 --> 00:24.370
<b>Thanks.</b>

00:25.200 --> 00:28.180
<b>Can I ask you to replenish
our stock of painkillers?</b>

00:28.830 --> 00:30.420
<b>I'll let Naji know.</b>

00:34.410 --> 00:36.950
<b>Come on! I said eat, Spacian!</b>

00:36.950 --> 00:38.860
<b>Sedo, Seethia.</b>

00:38.860 --> 00:39.680
<b>How is he?</b>

00:40.170 --> 00:42.110
<b>It's no use, Olcott.</b>

00:42.110 --> 00:43.910
<b>He won't eat a bite.</b>

00:43.910 --> 00:44.640
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:45.170 --> 00:47.650
<b>He keeps mumbling too.</b>

00:45.770 --> 00:48.140
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

00:48.140 --> 00:49.940
<b>What a weirdo.</b>

00:49.940 --> 00:52.110
<b>Dad, forgive me.</b>

00:53.060 --> 00:54.960
<b>I'm sorry, Dad...</b>

00:54.960 --> 00:56.680
<b>When did he last eat?</b>

00:56.680 --> 00:58.090
<b>Three days ago.</b>

00:58.560 --> 00:59.450
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

01:03.080 --> 01:04.280
<b>Sedo, give me that.</b>

01:04.280 --> 01:05.540
<b>Uh, sure.</b>

01:13.090 --> 01:17.430
<b>Guel Jeturk. You can be
our bargaining chip in negotiations.</b>

01:18.380 --> 01:21.840
<b>Don't think you can get out of this
by dying.</b>

02:53.760 --> 02:54.980
<b>We're evacuating?</b>

02:54.980 --> 02:57.440
<b>We got a message from Norea.</b>

02:57.440 --> 03:00.110
<b>It seems the Benerit Group
has sniffed us out.</b>

03:00.110 --> 03:02.030
<b>What about the refugees?</b>

03:02.030 --> 03:04.920
<b>I can't leave my family behind.</b>

03:04.920 --> 03:06.870
<b>We'll find a place for them to stay.</b>

03:06.870 --> 03:09.710
<b>We owe them for letting us hide here.</b>

03:09.710 --> 03:12.850
<b>Gristan, prepare to launch transports.</b>

03:13.250 --> 03:18.190
<b>Everyone else, prepare to take refugees
and cargo to the western airfield.</b>

03:18.190 --> 03:19.170
<b>Roger!</b>

03:18.190 --> 03:19.170
<b>Roger!</b>

03:19.940 --> 03:23.180
<b>Episode 15</b>

03:26.670 --> 03:29.780
<b>It's your fault Sophie died.</b>

03:29.780 --> 03:32.530
<b>Now you're putting Naji in danger too.</b>

03:32.840 --> 03:35.150
<b>Along with plenty of adults and children.</b>

03:35.150 --> 03:38.360
<b>All because of your silly ideals.</b>

03:38.360 --> 03:41.280
<b>Now, now! Calm down!</b>

03:41.280 --> 03:43.160
<b>It's not right.</b>

03:44.400 --> 03:46.670
<b>Just because you hate Spacians,</b>

03:47.070 --> 03:50.450
<b>you go on a rampage
for no reason and kill people...</b>

03:51.280 --> 03:53.600
<b>If all you do is cause suffering,</b>

03:53.600 --> 03:56.920
<b>no one will ever listen
to Earthians' voices.</b>

03:57.560 --> 04:00.260
<b>What you're doing is wrong!</b>

04:03.580 --> 04:05.180
<b>How dare you?!</b>

04:05.180 --> 04:08.390
<b>How dare you?! How dare you?!</b>

04:08.390 --> 04:13.600
<b>How dare you?! How dare you?!</b>

04:13.600 --> 04:15.490
<b>How dare you, you jerk?!</b>

04:16.110 --> 04:18.360
<b>That's enough.</b>

04:18.670 --> 04:20.360
<b>I can't let you kill this student.</b>

04:20.850 --> 04:24.380
<b>Don't forget
that your freedom is in our hands.</b>

04:24.380 --> 04:26.120
<b>Don't touch me, traitor!</b>

04:26.980 --> 04:29.550
<b>Because of her damned ego,</b>

04:29.550 --> 04:35.120
<b>dozens or hundreds of our comrades will be
killed in their so-called security operations.</b>

04:35.620 --> 04:39.050
<b>So tell me, which one of us
is causing suffering?</b>

04:40.910 --> 04:44.760
<b>I can pull the strings
to do anything at this school.</b>

04:45.310 --> 04:46.610
<b>It was easy.</b>

04:47.000 --> 04:48.470
<b>Both detaining you...</b>

04:49.130 --> 04:50.860
<b>and impersonating the guards.</b>

04:51.210 --> 04:53.570
<b>If all you wanted
was to inherit Grassley,</b>

04:53.570 --> 04:55.490
<b>you had plenty of chances.</b>

04:56.180 --> 04:57.860
<b>Is your real objective...</b>

04:57.860 --> 05:00.200
<b>the Presidency of the Group?</b>

05:00.680 --> 05:02.320
<b>I have a goal to accomplish.</b>

05:02.910 --> 05:07.910
<b>We covertly finance the massive costs of
space development through war partitioning.</b>

05:08.730 --> 05:10.300
<b>So you see, Father...</b>

05:10.820 --> 05:12.290
<b>I want to break this system.</b>

05:12.940 --> 05:14.600
<b>Shallow nonsense...</b>

05:14.600 --> 05:18.060
<b>The vested-interest structure
of war partitioning is untouchable.</b>

05:18.490 --> 05:19.840
<b>If you break it apart rashly...</b>

05:19.840 --> 05:23.100
<b>The Earth will be exhausted by proxy wars</b>

05:23.100 --> 05:25.630
<b>and corporations will
scramble for the shrunken pie.</b>

05:25.630 --> 05:27.940
<b>Profits will likely evaporate, too.</b>

05:28.420 --> 05:30.350
<b>But I have a better idea.</b>

05:31.250 --> 05:35.520
<b>We merely need to sell
all the Benerit Group's assets to Earth.</b>

05:36.010 --> 05:37.730
<b>To Earth?</b>

05:38.260 --> 05:40.980
<b>Who knows when the next war will start.</b>

05:40.980 --> 05:43.960
<b>We'll use the friction
between Earth and the corporations</b>

05:43.960 --> 05:46.850
<b>to create a situation
that works as deterrence.</b>

05:46.850 --> 05:51.670
<b>If we do that, no one will have
any need to start wars on Earth.</b>

05:53.820 --> 05:59.120
<b>Since you're half-Earthian,
are you trying to give weapons...</b>

05:59.780 --> 06:02.160
<b>to a conflict area like Earth</b>

06:02.160 --> 06:05.510
<b>as a way to work off
your grudge against Spacians?</b>

06:06.500 --> 06:08.520
<b>Grudges won't fill an empty stomach.</b>

06:09.170 --> 06:10.400
<b>Then again,</b>

06:10.400 --> 06:14.930
<b>as long as Spacians alone control
all the interests and keep exploiting us,</b>

06:14.930 --> 06:17.570
<b>one can't do anything without power.</b>

06:17.570 --> 06:18.950
<b>That's why...</b>

06:19.300 --> 06:20.900
<b>I'll be the one who seizes...</b>

06:21.390 --> 06:22.480
<b>that power.</b>

06:24.420 --> 06:28.420
<b>Benerit Group's Earth Garrison Forces</b>

06:24.890 --> 06:28.530
<b>No sign of targets
in EMS coverage area.</b>

06:28.530 --> 06:31.750
<b>Disperse and continue searching
as individual teams.</b>

06:31.750 --> 06:35.040
<b>If you meet resistance,
you're authorized to neutralize it.</b>

06:35.040 --> 06:36.120
<b>Copy that!</b>

06:37.740 --> 06:43.130
<b>Why aren't we Dominicus being sent out
rather than the Group's security forces?</b>

06:43.680 --> 06:47.510
<b>News of the incident at the school
has already leaked to the outside.</b>

06:48.000 --> 06:52.480
<b>It was the board's decision. They don't
want to owe anything to Cathedra.</b>

06:52.480 --> 06:55.560
<b>Is this something
corporations should handle on their own?</b>

06:56.050 --> 06:58.070
<b>I have a bad feeling about this.</b>

06:58.590 --> 07:00.400
<b>Or maybe what they want is...</b>

07:00.400 --> 07:01.190
<b>Huh?</b>

07:01.590 --> 07:04.120
<b>I have a visitor. I'll be in touch.</b>

07:05.560 --> 07:07.530
<b>Thank you for coming to see me.</b>

07:08.020 --> 07:09.960
<b>What can I do for you?</b>

07:09.960 --> 07:12.420
<b>There's something I'd like you to tell me.</b>

07:12.420 --> 07:13.490
<b>Me?</b>

07:14.400 --> 07:16.800
<b>What is Quiet Zero?</b>

07:17.580 --> 07:19.340
<b>Save the stockpiles for the next one!</b>

07:19.340 --> 07:20.510
<b>The sick are this way!</b>

07:20.510 --> 07:21.600
<b>Bring that here!</b>

07:21.300 --> 07:22.240
<b>Thank you!</b>

07:21.600 --> 07:23.040
<b>Come on, Bessie!</b>

07:23.040 --> 07:25.480
<b>Let me be the point man for this one!</b>

07:25.480 --> 07:27.980
<b>Didn't you hear the mission brief, Jalil?</b>

07:27.980 --> 07:30.100
<b>You have no experience, rookie.</b>

07:30.100 --> 07:32.110
<b>I proved myself at the plant!</b>

07:32.110 --> 07:34.320
<b>Meanwhile, you're acting
like a fraidy-cat.</b>

07:34.960 --> 07:36.640
<b>Unlike you, I have--</b>

07:36.640 --> 07:37.550
<b>Phillip!</b>

07:37.550 --> 07:39.280
<b>Don't lose your cool.</b>

07:39.880 --> 07:41.330
<b>Sorry.</b>

07:41.330 --> 07:44.530
<b>It's just that
when I think of my family...</b>

07:44.530 --> 07:48.160
<b>Where's Mr. Olcott?
Shouldn't he be packing too?</b>

07:48.160 --> 07:50.740
<b>That guy doesn't have
any personal belongings.</b>

07:51.390 --> 07:54.870
<b>He threw them all away long ago...</b>

07:59.150 --> 08:01.540
<b>They say it's a grave for Sophie.</b>

08:01.540 --> 08:04.720
<b>She was a hero to the kids, after all.</b>

08:05.030 --> 08:07.600
<b>We don't have time for this
in an evacuation.</b>

08:07.950 --> 08:09.800
<b>They don't want to forget.</b>

08:10.320 --> 08:11.690
<b>If they do,</b>

08:11.690 --> 08:15.690
<b>they'll be overwhelmed by the fear
that they could die next.</b>

08:16.760 --> 08:20.470
<b>Will pleading to the dead erase that fear?</b>

08:21.510 --> 08:24.310
<b>You, of all people, should understand.</b>

08:26.180 --> 08:27.790
<b>I've forgotten...</b>

08:29.480 --> 08:31.620
<b>We found a place for the refugees.</b>

08:31.620 --> 08:33.280
<b>The first flight can leave at any time.</b>

08:33.280 --> 08:35.830
<b>Understood. I'll go too.</b>

08:35.830 --> 08:37.130
<b>You there!</b>

08:37.130 --> 08:40.220
<b>Get in the vehicle! You'll be left behind!</b>

08:41.650 --> 08:44.360
<b>The transports will take off
at 5 o'clock in the morning.</b>

08:44.360 --> 08:46.010
<b>Take care of the rest.</b>

08:46.010 --> 08:48.900
<b>We mobile suit pilots will stay here.</b>

08:48.900 --> 08:51.050
<b>There's no telling
when the enemy could come.</b>

08:51.050 --> 08:52.480
<b>You'll act as decoys?</b>

08:52.480 --> 08:54.480
<b>We're all prepared.</b>

08:56.120 --> 08:57.720
<b>What about the little prince?</b>

08:58.380 --> 09:00.970
<b>If necessary, we'll use him
as a bargaining chip.</b>

09:00.970 --> 09:03.990
<b>I'm the one who insisted
on bringing him, after all.</b>

09:05.130 --> 09:06.700
<b>How honorable.</b>

09:06.700 --> 09:08.200
<b>That's just like you.</b>

09:11.100 --> 09:12.730
<b>You're not bringing a chain gun?</b>

09:12.730 --> 09:15.610
<b>I like to keep everything lightweight.</b>

09:16.100 --> 09:17.920
<b>Prodoros! Let's go!</b>

09:18.620 --> 09:21.370
<b>The garrison forces could arrive
as early as tonight.</b>

09:21.370 --> 09:23.870
<b>The priority is to keep them from
detecting the evacuation.</b>

09:24.470 --> 09:26.140
<b>Don't attack first.</b>

09:26.140 --> 09:28.260
<b>Avoid fighting if you can.</b>

09:28.260 --> 09:29.640
<b>If you encounter them,</b>

09:29.640 --> 09:31.730
<b>try to draw the enemy's fire</b>

09:31.730 --> 09:34.380
<b>to buy time for the transports
to take off.</b>

09:34.380 --> 09:36.020
<b>Roger!</b>

09:34.380 --> 09:36.020
<b>Roger!</b>

09:39.890 --> 09:42.720
<b>12 AM
Airfield</b>

09:41.210 --> 09:42.720
<b>There's about 20 percent left.</b>

09:42.720 --> 09:45.430
<b>We should finish loading in three hours.</b>

09:45.970 --> 09:47.700
<b>Send word when you're done.</b>

09:47.700 --> 09:49.450
<b>We'll rendezvous with Bessie's team.</b>

09:54.060 --> 09:56.080
<b>Damn, it's hot.</b>

09:56.080 --> 09:58.750
<b>It's the middle of the night, too...</b>

10:03.440 --> 10:04.790
<b>Let go!</b>

10:04.790 --> 10:06.210
<b>I said let me go!</b>

10:05.430 --> 10:06.970
<b>Why are you here?</b>

10:06.970 --> 10:08.600
<b>Let go!</b>

10:06.970 --> 10:08.600
<b>Get in the truck, now.</b>

10:08.600 --> 10:10.080
<b>B-But...</b>

10:10.080 --> 10:11.210
<b>Get in.</b>

10:12.740 --> 10:14.230
<b>He promised...</b>

10:15.030 --> 10:18.520
<b>that he'd come back from the plant.</b>

10:19.180 --> 10:23.240
<b>So instead of Dad,
why'd they bring you back?!</b>

10:24.570 --> 10:25.810
<b>Why...</b>

10:27.220 --> 10:30.440
<b>Why me and not Dad?</b>

10:31.300 --> 10:32.800
<b>If I...</b>

10:32.800 --> 10:34.360
<b>If I had died...</b>

10:34.890 --> 10:36.290
<b>Dad...</b>

10:37.530 --> 10:38.710
<b>That's right!</b>

10:38.710 --> 10:42.380
<b>If you'd died, my Dad would be...</b>

10:43.520 --> 10:45.300
<b>Give him back.</b>

10:46.150 --> 10:49.470
<b>Give me back my Daddy.</b>

10:55.910 --> 10:57.360
<b>You're bringing him?</b>

10:57.360 --> 10:58.190
<b>Yes.</b>

10:58.190 --> 10:59.230
<b>Why?</b>

10:59.230 --> 11:01.470
<b>What's the point? Didn't you hear?</b>

11:01.960 --> 11:04.740
<b>This guy's company
is about to go bankrupt...</b>

11:05.670 --> 11:09.270
<b>Even if that's true,
we can always use him as a shield.</b>

11:10.300 --> 11:11.990
<b>Bankrupt...</b>

11:11.990 --> 11:13.270
<b>Is that true?</b>

11:14.010 --> 11:15.580
<b>Tell me!</b>

11:15.580 --> 11:18.940
<b>Th-This is about my family!</b>

11:20.610 --> 11:21.910
<b>The garrison forces!</b>

11:21.910 --> 11:23.410
<b>They really came!</b>

11:41.840 --> 11:43.970
<b>That fool! Machei!</b>

11:43.970 --> 11:46.390
<b>Roger. Deploying ECM jammers.</b>

11:46.910 --> 11:48.280
<b>I'll head out and assist Jalil.</b>

11:48.280 --> 11:49.280
<b>Phillip!</b>

11:49.280 --> 11:51.360
<b>I knew this would happen...</b>

11:51.360 --> 11:52.310
<b>Damn it!</b>

11:52.310 --> 11:54.270
<b>You damn Spacians!</b>

11:54.770 --> 11:57.870
<b>Zulu 2 to Zulu 1!
We're under attack from the ground.</b>

11:57.870 --> 12:01.360
<b>Long-range comms are useless.
Descend and wipe them out.</b>

12:01.360 --> 12:04.080
<b>Roger! All units, descend and neutralize!</b>

12:06.320 --> 12:08.160
<b>You can't hit me!</b>

12:22.260 --> 12:23.470
<b>The school!</b>

12:23.690 --> 12:26.180
<b>Olcott! Come in, Olcott!!</b>

12:26.670 --> 12:27.360
<b>Damn it!</b>

12:27.360 --> 12:27.800
<b>Naji!</b>

12:28.030 --> 12:29.810
<b>There are four enemy mobile suits!</b>

12:30.030 --> 12:31.890
<b>What about the evacuees?</b>

12:31.890 --> 12:33.600
<b>Two vehicles have left!</b>

12:34.590 --> 12:36.700
<b>Just keep distracting them somehow!</b>

12:38.720 --> 12:40.400
<b>Jalil! Can you make the rendezvous?</b>

12:40.400 --> 12:42.310
<b>Y-Yes... I'm sorry about this!</b>

12:42.500 --> 12:44.840
<b>Phillip! Draw them toward the factory area!</b>

12:44.840 --> 12:45.680
<b>Roger!</b>

12:46.320 --> 12:47.870
<b>This way...</b>

12:47.870 --> 12:49.400
<b>Follow me, you dogs!</b>

12:53.710 --> 12:55.510
<b>Olcott!</b>

12:56.030 --> 12:58.060
<b>Wake up, Olcott!</b>

12:58.060 --> 13:00.520
<b>Say something! Olcott!</b>

13:01.330 --> 13:03.300
<b>Olcott! C'mon!</b>

13:04.560 --> 13:05.840
<b>Olcott!</b>

13:05.840 --> 13:06.470
<b>Da...</b>

13:09.520 --> 13:10.400
<b>...ddy...</b>

13:12.140 --> 13:13.520
<b>Olcott!</b>

13:15.520 --> 13:16.640
<b>Sedo...</b>

13:16.640 --> 13:19.370
<b>Olcott! Your body...</b>

13:19.370 --> 13:21.440
<b>The arm's artificial.
I won't die.</b>

13:23.350 --> 13:25.830
<b>Olcott, Seethia is...</b>

13:28.020 --> 13:29.450
<b>Seethia!</b>

13:34.610 --> 13:36.370
<b>We can't help her now.</b>

13:37.820 --> 13:40.140
<b>Join the evacuation by yourself.</b>

13:40.140 --> 13:40.670
<b>But--</b>

13:41.200 --> 13:42.050
<b>Give it up.</b>

13:42.980 --> 13:43.730
<b>Go!</b>

13:52.360 --> 13:53.660
<b>Was he crushed?</b>

14:00.480 --> 14:02.760
<b>Daddy...</b>

14:11.700 --> 14:12.830
<b>Machei!</b>

14:16.710 --> 14:17.710
<b>Got one!</b>

14:20.580 --> 14:21.330
<b>Huh?</b>

14:25.550 --> 14:26.920
<b>Jalil!</b>

14:27.150 --> 14:30.550
<b>You've done it now, you bastards!</b>

14:31.050 --> 14:32.740
<b>Phillip, stay calm!</b>

14:32.740 --> 14:33.850
<b>Don't fight them head on!</b>

14:42.520 --> 14:43.500
<b>Machei!</b>

14:43.500 --> 14:45.610
<b>Get some distance while you...</b>

14:52.490 --> 14:54.410
<b>There was another one?</b>

15:07.920 --> 15:09.230
<b>Olcott!</b>

15:09.230 --> 15:10.120
<b>Still alive, huh?</b>

15:10.120 --> 15:11.270
<b>Can you go on?</b>

15:11.270 --> 15:12.050
<b>Yeah.</b>

15:12.580 --> 15:14.820
<b>Forgive me. We lost Jalil.</b>

15:14.820 --> 15:15.970
<b>I see.</b>

15:15.970 --> 15:17.140
<b>Olcott!</b>

15:17.400 --> 15:19.310
<b>The last vehicle is about to leave!</b>

15:19.990 --> 15:21.140
<b>We're counting on you!</b>

15:43.980 --> 15:45.130
<b>I hear a vehicle!</b>

15:47.790 --> 15:49.060
<b>Why...</b>

15:49.500 --> 15:52.310
<b>What is it you want?</b>

15:53.540 --> 15:54.670
<b>I don't know.</b>

15:56.250 --> 15:58.450
<b>I don't know what I want.</b>

15:58.450 --> 15:59.100
<b>I...</b>

16:01.730 --> 16:04.280
<b>Phillip! Don't go in too deep!</b>

16:14.450 --> 16:15.200
<b>Phillip!</b>

16:15.790 --> 16:17.020
<b>Please...</b>

16:17.540 --> 16:18.280
<b>help the others...</b>

16:18.940 --> 16:20.410
<b>Make sure...</b>

16:20.410 --> 16:23.220
<b>they get out... of here alive...</b>

16:38.670 --> 16:39.990
<b>Machei...</b>

16:39.990 --> 16:40.990
<b>Gristan...</b>

16:40.990 --> 16:42.330
<b>Olcott.</b>

16:42.730 --> 16:45.440
<b>Sorry. I'm out of ammo.</b>

16:45.440 --> 16:46.720
<b>Wait, Bessie!</b>

16:46.720 --> 16:47.390
<b>I'll take the lead--</b>

16:47.390 --> 16:48.190
<b>I'm closing range!</b>

16:49.560 --> 16:51.480
<b>Cover me!</b>

17:06.290 --> 17:08.180
<b>Bessie's...</b>

17:08.180 --> 17:09.770
<b>Prodoros...</b>

17:10.530 --> 17:11.420
<b>That's one of their...</b>

17:12.050 --> 17:13.490
<b>mobile suits.</b>

17:27.180 --> 17:30.150
<b>The cockpit... still has power.</b>

17:35.810 --> 17:39.200
<b>Ridrick Kruger.... he's still alive?</b>

17:39.420 --> 17:42.440
<b>You recognize one of the names
on the suspect list?</b>

17:42.440 --> 17:43.830
<b>He's a former Dominicus member.</b>

17:44.050 --> 17:44.830
<b>What?</b>

17:44.830 --> 17:46.800
<b>He was an immature kid...</b>

17:46.800 --> 17:50.170
<b>Unafraid of higher-ups,
he stuck to his own sense of justice.</b>

17:50.600 --> 17:54.640
<b>But in the end, he was
attacked by Earthians himself.</b>

17:56.590 --> 17:59.800
<b>I guess his family were collateral damage.</b>

18:01.820 --> 18:03.120
<b>I threw all that away...</b>

18:06.370 --> 18:09.630
<b>I don't need... those damn things!</b>

18:22.820 --> 18:25.700
<b>The vehicle... Where is it?</b>

18:25.700 --> 18:27.540
<b>There were still more of--</b>

18:53.010 --> 18:53.990
<b>Is that Bessie?</b>

18:55.280 --> 18:56.320
<b>It's too late...</b>

19:02.380 --> 19:04.110
<b>She's dead.</b>

19:12.590 --> 19:13.770
<b>I see.</b>

19:15.030 --> 19:16.570
<b>What will you do now?</b>

19:16.570 --> 19:18.420
<b>Wait a bit before I join you.</b>

19:18.800 --> 19:20.940
<b>I need time to think.</b>

19:29.120 --> 19:32.230
<b>I heard someone saying "Daddy."</b>

19:33.470 --> 19:35.500
<b>I thought maybe she wanted him...</b>

19:36.050 --> 19:37.120
<b>to save her...</b>

19:39.720 --> 19:40.610
<b>Wait for me...</b>

19:41.520 --> 19:43.760
<b>I'm coming... to save you...</b>

19:46.860 --> 19:48.770
<b>What should I do?</b>

19:48.770 --> 19:50.790
<b>I'm not your father.</b>

19:52.400 --> 19:54.000
<b>As for what to do next...</b>

19:54.260 --> 19:56.310
<b>You'll have to think for yourself.</b>

20:00.450 --> 20:04.360
<b>Can you at least tell me
how to get to the orbital Permet lift?</b>

20:05.080 --> 20:05.640
<b>What?</b>

20:06.240 --> 20:08.900
<b>I don't want... to lose any more...</b>

20:10.150 --> 20:11.040
<b>of the things...</b>

20:12.110 --> 20:14.060
<b>that bind me to my father.</b>

21:46.470 --> 21:48.700
<b>It was a modest idea at first.</b>

21:49.270 --> 21:52.490
<b>As a botanical engineer,
Mistress Notrette thought</b>

21:52.490 --> 21:59.000
<b>that the various survival strategies used
by plants could also be applied to humanity.</b>

21:59.720 --> 22:02.060
<b>It was a dream
with no real basis,</b>

22:02.460 --> 22:04.880
<b>but that was just like her.</b>

22:05.620 --> 22:08.650
<b>And one of the people
who supported her vision...</b>

22:09.040 --> 22:10.600
<b>was Delling Rembran.</b>

22:11.210 --> 22:13.350
<b>Your father.</b>

22:14.160 --> 22:17.950
<b>I always thought my lousy father
made a marriage of convenience.</b>

22:18.550 --> 22:22.070
<b>He couldn't afford things like that
when he was a soldier.</b>

22:22.870 --> 22:24.560
<b>The battlefield...</b>

22:24.560 --> 22:26.490
<b>was so chaotic.</b>

22:27.560 --> 22:31.420
<b>People abandoned their own will
and left decisions to their weapons.</b>

22:32.280 --> 22:34.410
<b>Soldiers were consumed
as expendable parts.</b>

22:35.040 --> 22:37.830
<b>I lost many comrades as well.</b>

22:37.830 --> 22:40.310
<b>And that's why you began Gundam-hunting?</b>

22:41.490 --> 22:43.630
<b>The restoration of human nature.</b>

22:44.060 --> 22:47.420
<b>That's what the President desired,
even if it took drastic measures.</b>

22:50.040 --> 22:50.970
<b>And yet...</b>

22:51.360 --> 22:54.340
<b>even if he could control conflict
through war partitioning,</b>

22:55.030 --> 22:57.430
<b>he never managed to achieve order.</b>

22:58.440 --> 23:03.390
<b>That's why Mistress Notrette's vision
became a source of hope.</b>

23:05.500 --> 23:07.150
<b>Until she was lost in that accident...</b>

23:08.470 --> 23:10.910
<b>If he felt sad, he should have said so.</b>

23:11.730 --> 23:14.990
<b>There was always some new enemy
or rebellion.</b>

23:14.990 --> 23:17.630
<b>I finally get it.</b>

23:17.630 --> 23:21.100
<b>I understand why my lousy father
set up that marriage game.</b>

23:21.100 --> 23:25.900
<b>He thought it was safest to
marry me off to someone powerful.</b>

23:25.900 --> 23:29.350
<b>And it was also
good camouflage for Quiet Zero.</b>

23:30.690 --> 23:32.210
<b>The President...</b>

23:32.210 --> 23:35.350
<b>intends to fulfill his vow
to Mistress Notrette</b>

23:35.350 --> 23:38.170
<b>even if he has to use
the very Gundams he buried.</b>

23:38.600 --> 23:40.620
<b>But you, Mistress Miorine...</b>

23:41.280 --> 23:42.560
<b>Your life is yours.</b>

23:43.310 --> 23:44.980
<b>You are not your father.</b>

23:45.850 --> 23:48.570
<b>Please... follow your own heart.</b>

23:53.920 --> 24:01.960
<b>Episode 16</b>

23:54.100 --> 23:58.510
<b>Next time on
Mobile Suit Gundam the Witch from Mercury,</b>

23:58.860 --> 24:00.510
<b>"Cycle of Sin."</b>

24:01.960 --> 24:03.700
<b>Illustration: Akima</b>
